=== B4 (Q2) static limit: coupling ID, cold carrier at rest, lam W_rem'(u) = g_N
  canonical: max |nu_ID/nu_s - 1| = inf; deep coefficient u^2/(g_N a0) at y=1e-4: nan -> FAIL
  alt: max |nu_ID/nu_s - 1| = inf; deep coefficient u^2/(g_N a0) at y=1e-4: nan -> FAIL
  M2 isolated (saturation 2 a0): max dev 4.121e-01, deep coefficient 1.9859 (must be != 1)
  Coupling G: a cold carrier at rest feels g_N + g_c + g_bound (all inward); the action gives it no outward force, so there is
  NO static cold equilibrium and C_sel = 0 exactly (the carrier is ordinary collisionless matter in the total potential).

